body:
Hey! We actually already have a list of DOM that should be outputted by InstantSearch in a separate project, but since that's a major change, we will do that all at once.

For now, what problem do you have with the css with it being there? As a workaround you should be able to make it "completely gone" with display: contents like this:

```css
.ais-current-refined-values--body div {
  display: contents;
}
```

Or you can do the changes you planned to do on the body on the div instead.

I hope that helps!
